      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而距离活动当天还非常遥远。\n她却从当时就一直练习到现在，\n确实很像个性认真的她的作风……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3939bf6272d789f0b099998c83a9bf2342794dd1ecd9b7a3a6616a5a525e300b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
